h an <strong data-start=\"1276\" data-end=\"1310\">Intel-based Gigabit controller</strong>, it ensures stable data transfer, low latency, and compatibility with major operating systems, including <strong data-start=\"1415\" data-end=\"1457\">Windows Server, Linux, and VMware ESXi</strong>. Each of its four Gigabit ports supports <strong data-start=\"1499\" data-end=\"1532\">auto-negotiation, full-duplex</strong>, and advanced features such as <strong data-start=\"1564\" data-end=\"1628\">VLAN tagging, Jumbo Frames, LACP (Link Aggregation), and QoS</strong> for efficient traffic management.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1666\" data-end=\"1865\">This card is ideal for use in <strong data-start=\"1696\" data-end=\"1771\">virtualization environments, firewall routers, and multi-network setups</strong>, providing dependable and scalable networking performance for enterprises and data centers.</p><p data-start=\"1666\" data-end=\"1865\"><br></p><h3 data-start=\"1872\" data-end=\"1895\"><strong data-start=\"1879\" data-end=\"1895\">Key Features</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1896\" data-end=\"2221\"><li data-start=\"1896\" data-end=\"1940\">\n<p data-start=\"1898\" data-end=\"1940\">4 × 10/100/1000 Mbps RJ45 Ethernet ports</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1941\" data-end=\"1979\">\n<p data-start=\"1943\" data-end=\"1979\">PCI Express (PCIe x4/x8) interface</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1980\" data-end=\"2032\">\n<p data-start=\"1982\" data-end=\"2032\">Intel Gigabit controller for maximum reliability</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"2033\" data-end=\"2075\">\n<p data-start=\"2035\" data-end=\"2075\">Supports VLAN, Jumbo Frames, LACP, QoS</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"2076\" data-end=\"2118\">\n<p data-start=\"2078\" data-end=\"2118\">Compatible with Windows, Linux, and VMware</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"2119\" data-end=\"2173\">\n<p data-start=\"2121\" data-end=\"2173\">Ideal for servers, routers, and network appliances</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"2174\" data-end=\"2221\">\n<p data-start=\"2176\" dat